{"parents": [], "prev": {"link": "../utils/helpers/", "title": "Helpers"}, "next": null, "title": "Telemetry", "meta": {}, "body": "<section id=\"module-telemetry\">\n<span id=\"telemetry\"></span><h1>Telemetry<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-telemetry\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>Telemetry support for auth0-server-python SDK.</p>\n<p>Builds and caches the Auth0-Client and User-Agent headers sent\non every HTTP request to Auth0 endpoints.</p>\n<section id=\"classes\">\n<h2>Classes<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#classes\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper autosummary longtable docutils container\">\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#telemetry.Telemetry\" title=\"telemetry.Telemetry\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Telemetry</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Builds telemetry headers for Auth0 HTTP requests.</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-contents\">\n<h2>Module Contents<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-contents\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"telemetry.Telemetry\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">telemetry.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">Telemetry</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">name</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">version</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">env</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#telemetry.Telemetry\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Builds telemetry headers for Auth0 HTTP requests.</p>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"telemetry.Telemetry.default\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">static</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">default</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#telemetry.Telemetry\" title=\"telemetry.Telemetry\"><span class=\"pre\">Telemetry</span></a></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#telemetry.Telemetry.default\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Create a Telemetry instance with this SDK\u2019s package metadata.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"telemetry.Telemetry.env\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">env</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#telemetry.Telemetry.env\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"telemetry.Telemetry.headers\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">headers</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#telemetry.Telemetry.headers\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"telemetry.Telemetry.name\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">name</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#telemetry.Telemetry.name\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"telemetry.Telemetry.version\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">version</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#telemetry.Telemetry.version\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["reference/utils/helpers/index", "Helpers", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "reference/telemetry/index.rst.txt", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">Telemetry</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#classes\">Classes</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#module-contents\">Module Contents</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#telemetry.Telemetry\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Telemetry</span></code></a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#telemetry.Telemetry.default\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Telemetry.default()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#telemetry.Telemetry.env\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Telemetry.env</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#telemetry.Telemetry.headers\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Telemetry.headers</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#telemetry.Telemetry.name\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Telemetry.name</